OL,3,GNEWSAEvents to mark baby loss awareness
OL,4,Aweek
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of events will be held to help
OL,7,Fbereaved families mark Baby Loss
OL,8,FAwareness week.
OL,10,FRemembrance services will be held in
OL,11,FHull, Scunthorpe and Grimsby and
OL,12,Fbabies' names added to a memory tree at
OL,13,FHull Women and Children's Hospital.
OL,15,FMore than 100 families who have been
OL,16,Faffected by the loss of a baby will
OL,17,Falso take part in a lantern walk in
OL,18,FLincoln.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
