OL,3,GNEWSAEvents to mark baby loss awareness
OL,4,Aweek
OL,5,
OL,6,FRachel Bond, specialist midwife at
OL,7,FUnited Lincolnshire Teaching Hospitals
OL,8,FNHS Trust (LUTH), said: "Sadly,
OL,9,Falthough baby loss is far more common
OL,10,Fthan many people realise, it remains a
OL,11,Fsubject that can be difficult to talk
OL,12,Fabout.
